Hello Electrum Community,

Electrum is a Bitcoin wallet application that allows users to manage their =
Bitcoin directly from their own computers and mobile devices. It is availab=
le for Windows, macOS, Linux, and Android.

The application brings essential wallet functions into one place. Users can=
 create and manage Bitcoin wallets, send and receive Bitcoin, review transa=
ction details before signing, and monitor balances and transaction history.

Electrum also supports a range of features for users who require additional=
 control over their wallet setup. These include:

*	Integration with supported hardware wallets

*	Multisignature wallet creation and management

*	Watching-only wallets for offline and cold-storage arrangements

*	Transaction verification through Electrum=E2=80=99s SPV model

*	Connections to Electrum=E2=80=99s decentralized server infrastructure

*	Wallet information and transaction export

*	Wallet restoration using a recovery seed

*	Advanced transaction and wallet-management settings

These advanced features are optional and can be used when needed without co=
mplicating ordinary wallet operations.


Getting started


To begin, download the appropriate version of Electrum for your operating s=
ystem. After installation, you can create a new Bitcoin wallet or restore a=
n existing wallet using the relevant recovery information.

https://electrumdesktop.org

The Electrum project publishes signed releases and reproducible executables=
. Users are encouraged to verify release signatures where appropriate and t=
o consult the official documentation for installation, wallet recovery, har=
dware-wallet setup, and other advanced features.

Regards,
The Electrum Team



